# Reusable Components

Build UI once; reuse everywhere. Do not copy-paste near-identical JSX.

## Where things live

| Kind | Location |
|------|----------|
| Primitives (Button, Input, Dialog…) | `components/ui/` (shadcn) or `packages/ui` |
| Layout / nav / chrome | `components/layout/`, `components/navigation/` |
| Cross-feature shared | `components/shared/` |
| Domain-specific | `features/<domain>/components/` |
| 3D primitives | `components/3d/` |

Promote to `components/shared/` or `packages/ui` when a feature component is needed in **2+ features**.

## Rules

- Props-driven variants (`variant`, `size`, `state`) — not forked copies.
- Compose small pieces; no giant mega-components.
- Shared visual language: design tokens from `docs/ui-design.md`.
- Loading / empty / error: reuse shared state components when possible.
- Product card, price, rating, stock badge, quantity stepper = shared — not redefined per page.

## Avoid

```tsx
// ❌ Same card markup in Shop, Wishlist, and Admin with tiny diffs
// ✅ <ProductCard product={p} actions={['cart','wishlist']} />
```

When adding UI, first search existing `components/` and `features/*/components/` for something to extend.
